14.
Venue for conducting mediation.
- Mediation proceedings shall be conducted at one or other of the following places:
(i)
Mediation Centre;
(ii)
Venue of the Lok Adalat or Permanent Lok Adalat;
(iii)
Any place identified by the High Court;
(iv)
Any place identified by the District Judge with the approval of the High Court within the Court precincts;
(V)
Any other place as may be agreed upon by the parties subject to approval of the Court.
